data: {"type": "speech_text.final", "source_agent": "speech_text_agent", "node": "speech_text_result", "text": "Here are the three senior welfare centers located in the Gangnam district that I could find.\n\nFirst, there's the Nonhyeon Senior Comprehensive Welfare Center. It's at Nonhyeon‑dong, Gangnam‑gu, Seoul, and you can reach them at 02‑541‑0226. If you need directions, you can click on the link to view its location on Naver Maps.\n\nNext, we have the Gangnam Senior Comprehensive Welfare Center. It’s located in Samseong‑dong, also in Gangnam‑gu, Seoul. Their phone number is 02‑549‑7070, and you can find the exact spot on Naver Maps by following the link I’ve provided.\n\nFinally, the Yeoksam Senior Welfare Center is situated in Yeoksam‑dong, Gangnam‑gu, Seoul. They can be contacted at 02‑501‑5674, and you can check their location on Naver Maps with the link below.\n\nIf you’d like more details—such as the exact neighborhood closest to you, opening hours, eligibility criteria, or the programs they offer—just let me know and I’ll gather that information for you.", "session_id": "agent-eval-agent-ext-001-20260624t081520418629z", "turn_id": "e0984be24ef54dfe824befa03e2feeab"}

